  &lt;article class=&quot;onebox-body&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;aspect-image&quot; style=&quot;--aspect-ratio:690/402;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/d/4/cd49b65780faf86c14ed9761c9c522acfb73adde_2_500x500.png&quot; class=&quot;thumbnail&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;865F5C&quot; width=&quot;500&quot; height=&quot;500&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.04847&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;MusaCoder: Native GPU Kernel Generation with Full-Stack Training on Moore...&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;Native GPU kernel generation turns high-level tensor programs into executable, efficient low-level code. Existing Large Language Models (LLMs) struggle with this task, while execution-based reinforcement learning suffers from sparse rewards, reward...&lt;/p&gt;


